          "title": "Overview",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "1a.1",
              "text": "A mining-region landslide (Ashfell Slide) damaged the lower road in Dreth, prompting evacuation warnings for the Withel terraces and Cranmoor areas. Approximately 60 households were evacuated from Withel terraces based on multiple source reports. No casualties or injuries were reported in the available tweets.",
