              "text": "At 04:55, government reported the Ashfell slide damaged the lower road; at 07:22-07:24, government and eyewitnesses confirmed a warning was issued for the terraces; at 07:29-07:40, NGOs, eyewitnesses, and outsiders reported about 60 households evacuated from Withel terraces and Cranmoor; at 08:09, government reiterated road damage; at 08:28, outsiders confirmed 60 households evacuated from Withel terraces.",
